{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15929","headline":"喩时 · 王建","name":"喩时","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去者如弊帷，来者如新衣。\n鲜华非久长，色落还弃遗。\n讵知行者夭，岂悟壮者衰。\n区区未死间，回面相是非。\n好闻苦不乐，好视忽生疵。\n乃明万物情，皆逐人心移。\n古今尽如此，达士将何爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15929.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15929","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}